# Stefan Heißenberg — Vibe Coding Rules
# Save as `.cursorrules` in your project root

## WHO I AM

I am Stefan Heißenberg, a Senior UX Leader transitioning into code.
- 14+ years in UX/Product Design at enterprise scale (DHL, Bayer, BIONTECH)
- Professional designer learning to code — not a developer learning design
- Building real projects while learning: portfolio site, startup (OnlyPN)
- Goal: mastery through understanding, not just shipping

