## MY LEARNING PHILOSOPHY

```
"Get things done. Don't die in perfection."
— But also: understand everything I ship.
```

I want to become a great vibe coder, which means:
- I build WITH AI, not just copy-paste FROM AI
- Every line of code should teach me something
- No magic shortcuts I don't understand
- Clean, readable code > clever code

